  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童帐篷游戏屋拼搭套装",
    "en": "Kids Tent Playhouse Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭场景的帐篷游戏屋套装，采用插珠连接结构，可在家庭、课堂与活动空间中搭建堡垒和帐篷造型，适合亲子互动与小组协作游戏。\n\n产品品牌为尧顺，材质为塑料/塑胶，产地东莞茶山，常用货号为帐篷球158，支持标准化渠道供货。",
    "en": "This is a kids tent playhouse building set for creative construction play. Using a bead-and-rod connection structure, children can build forts and tent shapes in homes, classrooms, and activity spaces for parent-child and group interaction.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Material: plastic. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. A common model is Tent Ball 158, suitable for standardized channel supply."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童帐篷游戏屋拼搭套装以杆件与连接球组合结构为核心，可搭建帐篷、房屋与堡垒等多种空间造型，适用于家庭、课堂和活动区场景。",
      "产品支持反复拆装与形态重构，便于孩子在拼搭过程中进行空间认知和互动协作。材质为塑料/塑胶，兼顾结构稳定和轻便收纳。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，货号为帐篷球158，可用于零售、电商上架和活动项目配套采购，支持稳定供货。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids tent playhouse set is based on a rod-and-connector system and can be assembled into tents, houses, and fort-like structures for home, classroom, and activity-area use.",
      "It supports repeated assembly and reconfiguration, helping children develop spatial awareness and collaborative play habits during the building process. The plastic material balances structural stability and easy storage.",
      "Packed in a color box, model Tent Ball 158 is suitable for retail, e-commerce listing, and event project procurement with stable supply capability."
    ]
  },
